Third-party components
======================

webgpu-headers (https://github.com/webgpu-native/webgpu-headers)
  Copyright 2019-2023 WebGPU-Native developers
  BSD 3-Clause License: vendor/webgpu-headers/LICENSE
  Vendored in vendor/webgpu-headers/ (webgpu.yml, webgpu.h, articles/). The
  generated bindings (WebGPU/Raw/*.lean, c/generated/) are generated from
  webgpu.yml, and carry its documentation; each says so in its banner.

wgpu-native (https://github.com/gfx-rs/wgpu-native)
  MIT or Apache-2.0. Not part of this repository: vendor/wgpu-native/fetch.sh
  downloads a release, which programs built natively link.

SDL3 (https://libsdl.org)
  Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga
  zlib License. Not part of this repository: vendor/sdl3/fetch.sh fetches a
  release, which the window library (WebGPUWindow) links natively.

Dawn, emdawnwebgpu (https://dawn.googlesource.com/dawn)
  BSD 3-Clause License. Not part of this repository: Emscripten's port,
  which the web build links.

Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and libuv (https://libuv.org)
  Apache-2.0 and MIT. Not part of this repository: the web build fetches their
  sources (vendor/lean4/fetch.sh, vendor/libuv/fetch.sh) and compiles them.
